Phase 1 is implemented.

- Added deterministic calculator helpers, persistence parsing, browser exports, scenario logic, and neutral fallbacks.
- Added 16 focused tests covering arithmetic, boundaries, malformed inputs, storage, and non-mutation.
- Updated model documentation, repository rules, and the required handoff.
- Syntax checks and all 16 tests pass.
- `npm install` could not complete because registry DNS was unavailable; no dependency or lockfile changes were made.
